  "translation": "Ọ dịghị Abnere ụtịa nke ukwuu n'ihi okwu Ish-Boshet, o wee sị, \"M ka isi nkịta m bụ nke sitere na Yehuda? Taa m na-eme chesed—ịhụnanya ọgbụgba-ndụ—ya na ụlọ Shaụl, nna gị, ya na ụmụnne ya, na ya na eji ya, ma abụghị m nyere gị n'aka Dawid, ma ị na-ebute mmehie nke nwanyị ahụ n'elu m taa?\"",
